I agree with Bob — much of the confusing arises from the fact
that we’re learning on the job.  Speaking for myself my current
research into the more theoretical perspectives like ergodicity
brings new understanding into common pathologies and motivates
new strategies.  The very construction of Stan is fueling new
understanding of both HMC and MCMC!

The manual is due for a big update and we’ve made the first
steps towards that.  Hopefully out outreach efforts (speaking,
meet ups, etc) will also contribute to getting the most recent
principles out sooner.

